{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ遅くなってごめんなさい\nm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木夜公演最後の方から熱が出てしまいました。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももう大丈夫です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは 少しずつだけど強くなれてます！\n皆が強さをくれるから、それにこたえたいから\nこれからもっと まあやらしく、でももっともっと成長して行きたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思わせてくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n掘ちゃん。。おめでとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは皆素敵な人ばかりです！\nだから安心だよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやに出来る事があればいつでも言ってね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強も頑張ってるんだよぅ~♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前英語のテストで満点取れた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近いい感じ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校楽しい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんとっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノギドコ収録の時の〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まあやはどれでしょうか〜)\n学校のお友達と遊びに行った時の~♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々木にお花を送ってくれてありがとうございました(///ω///)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして。うん！\n自分を見失わず\n泣いたり笑ったり一緒に未来を目指してほしいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの笑顔が皆に届きますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表後、大好きな星野みなみ！！！\nみなみが\n『まあやの家に泊まりたい！』\nっていってくれて、沢山お話しました！\nミナミファンの皆様！やっぱりみなみは素敵ですぅぅぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/10/08/4126935/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}